# Firebase Deploy Safety

This repo uses the shared Firebase project `p5-firebase-eebc1`.

The project contains functions from other apps/projects. Never run a broad
functions deploy that can delete or overwrite functions outside this repo.

Allowed:

```bash
firebase deploy --only functions:fetchUgTab
```

Do not run:

```bash
firebase deploy --only functions
```

Only delete or overwrite other deployed functions if the user explicitly names
the exact functions and confirms deletion in the current conversation.
